late or understand Loan Amount details.","@type":"HowToDirection"}]},{"url":"https://calczen.in/blog/finance/mortgage-calculator-estimate-your-monthly-mortgage-payment#heading-13","name":"Interest Rate","@type":"HowToStep","position":14,"itemListElement":[{"text":"Learn how to calculate or understand Interest Rate details.","@type":"HowToDirection"}]},{"url":"https://calczen.in/blog/finance/mortgage-calculator-estimate-your-monthly-mortgage-payment#heading-14","name":"Loan Term","@type":"HowToStep","position":15,"itemListElement":[{"text":"Learn how to calculate or understand Loan Term details.","@type":"HowToDirection"}]},{"url":"https://calczen.in/blog/finance/mortgage-calculator-estimate-your-monthly-mortgage-payment#heading-15","name":"Property Taxes","@type":"HowToStep","position":16,"itemListElement":[{"text":"Learn how to calculate or understand Property Taxes details.","@type":"HowToDirection"}]},{"url":"https://calczen.in/blog/finance/mortgage-calculator-estimate-your-monthly-mortgage-payment#heading-16","name":"Homeowners Insurance","@type":"HowToStep","position":17,"itemListElement":[{"text":"Learn how to calculate or understand Homeowners Insurance details.","@type":"HowToDirection"}]},{"url":"https://calczen.in/blog/finance/mortgage-calculator-estimate-your-monthly-mortgage-payment#heading-17","name":"Mortgage Insurance","@type":"HowToStep","position":18,"itemListElement":[{"text":"Learn how to calculate or understand Mortgage Insurance details.","@type":"HowToDirection"}]},{"url":"https://calczen.in/blog/finance/mortgage-calculator-estimate-your-monthly-mortgage-payment#heading-18","name":"Fixed-Rate Mortgage","@type":"HowToStep","position":19,"itemListElement":[{"text":"Learn how to calculate or understand Fixed-Rate Mortgage details.","@type":"HowToDirection"}]},{"url":"https://calczen.in/blog/finance/mortgage-calculator-estimate-your-monthly-mortgage-payment#heading-19","name":"Adjustable-Rate Mortgage (ARM)","@type":"HowToStep","position":20,"itemL