.","@type":"HowToDirection"}]},{"url":"https://calczen.in/blog/finance/mortgage-calculator-estimate-your-monthly-mortgage-payment#heading-33","name":"Focusing Only on the Monthly Payment","@type":"HowToStep","position":34,"itemListElement":[{"text":"Learn how to calculate or understand Focusing Only on the Monthly Payment details.","@type":"HowToDirection"}]},{"url":"https://calczen.in/blog/finance/mortgage-calculator-estimate-your-monthly-mortgage-payment#heading-34","name":"Ignoring Additional Homeownership Costs","@type":"HowToStep","position":35,"itemListElement":[{"text":"Learn how to calculate or understand Ignoring Additional Homeownership Costs details.","@type":"HowToDirection"}]},{"url":"https://calczen.in/blog/finance/mortgage-calculator-estimate-your-monthly-mortgage-payment#heading-35","name":"Not Comparing Lenders","@type":"HowToStep","position":36,"itemListElement":[{"text":"Learn how to calculate or understand Not Comparing Lenders details.","@type":"HowToDirection"}]},{"url":"https://calczen.in/blog/finance/mortgage-calculator-estimate-your-monthly-mortgage-payment#heading-36","name":"Changing Your Financial Situation Before Closing","@type":"HowToStep","position":37,"itemListElement":[{"text":"Learn how to calculate or understand Changing Your Financial Situation Before Closing details.","@type":"HowToDirection"}]},{"url":"https://calczen.in/blog/finance/mortgage-calculator-estimate-your-monthly-mortgage-payment#heading-37","name":"Step 1","@type":"HowToStep","position":38,"itemListElement":[{"text":"Learn how to calculate or understand Step 1 details.","@type":"HowToDirection"}]},{"url":"https://calczen.in/blog/finance/mortgage-calculator-estimate-your-monthly-mortgage-payment#heading-38","name":"Step 2","@type":"HowToStep","position":39,"itemListElement":[{"text":"Learn how to calculate or understand Step 2 details.","@type":"HowToDirection"}]},{"url":"https://calczen.in/blog/finance/mortgage-calculator-estimate-your-monthly-mortgage-payment#head