"question":"Are AI certifications enough to get a job?"}],"toc":[{"id":"heading-0","text":"Why AI Skills Matter More Than Coding in 2026","level":2},{"id":"heading-1","text":"Why AI Skills Are Becoming Essential","level":2},{"id":"heading-2","text":"Industries Rapidly Adopting AI","level":3},{"id":"heading-3","text":"Skill 1: AI Workflow Automation","level":2},{"id":"heading-4","text":"Popular AI Automation Tools","level":3},{"id":"heading-5","text":"Skill 2: Prompt Engineering","level":2},{"id":"heading-6","text":"Example of Prompt Quality","level":3},{"id":"heading-7","text":"Skill 3: AI Research and Information Verification","level":2},{"id":"heading-8","text":"Human vs AI Responsibilities","level":3},{"id":"heading-9","text":"Skill 4: AI Data Analysis","level":2},{"id":"heading-10","text":"Benefits of AI Data Analysis","level":3},{"id":"heading-11","text":"Skill 5: AI Content Strategy","level":2},{"id":"heading-12","text":"Elements of High-Quality AI-Assisted Content","level":3},{"id":"heading-13","text":"Skill 6: AI Agent Development","level":2},{"id":"heading-14","text":"Popular AI Agent Platforms","level":3},{"id":"heading-15","text":"Skill 7: AI-Assisted Programming","level":2},{"id":"heading-16","text":"Traditional Development vs AI-Assisted Development","level":3},{"id":"heading-17","text":"Skill 8: Critical Thinking","level":2},{"id":"heading-18","text":"Skill 9: Communication and Collaboration","level":2},{"id":"heading-19","text":"Skill 10: Continuous Learning","level":2},{"id":"heading-20","text":"AI Career Roadmap for Beginners","level":2},{"id":"heading-21","text":"Common Mistakes to Avoid","level":2},{"id":"heading-22","text":"Future-Proof Your Career with AI","level":2}]},{"_id":"eba2e4d7-c191-4b26-ae80-4cbb7638c22b","title":"Body Fat Calculator: Calculate Your Body Fat Percentage & Understand Your Health","slug":"body-fat-calculator-calculate-your-body-fat-percentage-understand-your-health","excerpt":"Weight alone doesn't tell the whole story abou