,"text":"Stay Physically Active","level":2},{"id":"heading-31","text":"Get Enough Sleep","level":2},{"id":"heading-32","text":"Stay Hydrated","level":2},{"id":"heading-33","text":"Obsessing Over the Scale","level":3},{"id":"heading-34","text":"Chasing Extremely Low Body Fat","level":3},{"id":"heading-35","text":"Following Crash Diets","level":3},{"id":"heading-36","text":"Ignoring Strength Training","level":3},{"id":"heading-37","text":"Comparing Yourself to Others","level":3}]},{"_id":"677dd6dc-60e1-4b8b-84b1-407b5ba5d99a","title":"FD Calculator: Estimate Your Fixed Deposit Returns & Interest Earnings Easily","slug":"fd-calculator-estimate-your-fixed-deposit-returns-interest-earnings-easily","excerpt":"Planning to invest in a Fixed Deposit? Use an FD Calculator to instantly estimate your maturity amount, total interest earned, and investment growth. Learn how fixed deposits work, how interest is calculated, and how to maximize your returns with this comprehensive guide.","content":"$1d","thumbnail":"/uploads/blog/fd-calculator-estimate-your-fixed-deposit-returns-interest-earnings-easily.webp","category":"Finance","tags":["Fixed Deposit","FD Calculator","Savings","Investment","Personal Finance"],"metaTitle":"FD Calculator | Calculate Fixed Deposit Returns","metaDescription":"Use our free FD Calculator to calculate fixed deposit maturity amount, interest earned, and investment returns instantly.","keywords":["fd calculator","fixed deposit calculator","fd interest calculator","maturity calculator","fixed deposit interest"],"author":"CalcZen Team","calculatorLinks":[],"faqs":[{"answer":"An FD Calculator estimates your maturity amount and total interest earned based on your deposit amount, interest rate, tenure, and compounding frequency.","question":"What is an FD Calculator?"},{"answer":"Generally, Fixed Deposits provide guaranteed returns based on the agreed interest rate, provided you hold the investment until maturity and subject to the terms of the issuing financi