s","metaDescription":"Use our FD Calculator to estimate your Fixed Deposit maturity amount and interest earnings. Learn how FD interest is calculated and maximize your savings.","keywords":["FD calculator","fixed deposit calculator","FD interest calculator","fixed deposit interest","FD maturity calculator","bank FD calculator","calculate FD returns","FD investment","fixed deposit returns","FD interest rate"],"author":"CalcZen Team","calculatorLinks":[],"faqs":[{"answer":"An FD Calculator is an online tool that estimates the maturity amount and interest earned on a Fixed Deposit based on your investment amount, interest rate, tenure, and compounding frequency.","question":"What is an FD Calculator?"},{"answer":"FD interest is calculated using either simple interest or compound interest, depending on the financial institution and the type of Fixed Deposit.","question":"How is FD interest calculated?"},{"answer":"You'll typically need your investment amount, annual interest rate, deposit tenure, and compounding frequency to estimate your returns.","question":"What information do I need to use an FD Calculator?"},{"answer":"Many banks allow premature withdrawal, but penalties or reduced interest rates may apply. Check your bank's specific terms before investing.","question":"Can I withdraw my Fixed Deposit before maturity?"}],"featured":true,"published":true,"views":11,"readingTime":12,"publishDate":"2026-06-14T10:26:52.74+00:00","createdAt":"2026-06-14T10:26:53.347034+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-07-17T06:03:16.01196+00:00","schema":"$2a","jsonld":[{"@id":"https://calczen.in/blog/finance/fd-calculator-calculate-fixed-deposit-returns-easily#blogposting","@type":"BlogPosting","image":["https://calczen.in/uploads/blog/fd-calculator-calculate-fixed-deposit-returns-easily.webp"],"author":{"name":"CalcZen Team","@type":"Person","jobTitle":"Technical SEO Architect","worksFor":{"url":"https://calczen.in","name":"CalcZen","@type":"Organization"}},"@context":"https://schema.org","he